[1.5, 1.5, 4.0]. In all modes, a is approximately -0.1. Transitions occur when  
x_i falls to 18.0 (turning a heater on) or rises to 22.0 (turning it off). No   
resets were found as the maximum jump between consecutive x values is negligible
