structure, specifically looking for time and state variable arrays. Then, I'll  
compute the derivatives of the state variables to segment the trajectory into   
the four discrete modes based on whether specific variables are increasing or   
decreasing. For each mode, I will perform a linear regression to fit the        
first-order ODE $dx_i/dt = a_i x_i + b_i$ and check for a common cooling        
