thermostat: heating starts when $x_i$ drops below $L_i \approx 19.0$ and stops  
when $x_i$ exceeds $H_i \approx 21.0$.                                          
                                                                                
### 2. Task outcome (extremely detailed version):                               
**1. Model Fitting ($dx_i/dt = -k_i x_i + C_i$):**                              
Using linear regression on the state derivatives, the following parameters were 
